</div>
<div class="stats rv" style="--d:.55s">
<div><b>36</b><span>款早秋新品</span></div>
<div><b>12</b><span>家线下门店</span></div>
<div><b>48H</b><span>顺丰发货</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hr rv" style="--d:.25s">
<div class="pc pc1"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path fill="#C9A87C" d="M42 26 L54 17 Q60 14 66 17 L78 26 L89 48 L80 55 L77 99 Q60 106 43 99 L40 55 L31 48 Z"/><path d="M54 19 L60 34 L66 19" fill="none" stroke="rgba(40,25,8,.35)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M60 34 V99" stroke="rgba(40,25,8,.18)" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="44" y="60" width="32" height="5" fill="rgba(40,25,8,.28)"/></svg><b>「白露」羊绒大衣</b></div>
<div class="pc pc2"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path fill="#B4552F" d="M48 22 Q60 15 72 22 L74 44 C77 50 76 54 74 58 L86 97 Q60 107 34 97 L46 58 C44 54 43 50 46 44 Z"/><path d="M48 24 Q60 32 72 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(50,15,5,.35)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M46 60 H74" stroke="rgba(50,15,5,.2)"/></svg><b>「柿染」针织连衣裙</b></div>
<div class="pc pc3"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path fill="#33312E" d="M43 25 L57 18 L60 32 L63 18 L77 25 L86 44 L77 51 L75 92 Q60 98 45 92 L43 51 L34 44 Z"/><path d="M57 18 L52 40 L60 32 M63 18 L68 40 L60 32" fill="rgba(240,235,225,.16)"/><circle cx="60" cy="52" r="1.6" fill="rgba(240,235,225,.5)"/></svg><b>「玄青」单西外套</b></div>
<div class="sticker">早秋上新<br>限时九折</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<!-- 面料跑马灯 -->
<div class="fab tick"><div class="row">
<span class="ti">桑蚕丝<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">美丽诺羊毛<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">新疆长绒棉<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">醋酸纤维<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">阿拉善山羊绒<em>✦</em></span>
<span class="ti">桑蚕丝<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">美丽诺羊毛<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">新疆长绒棉<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">醋酸纤维<em>✦</em></span><span class="ti">阿拉善山羊绒<em>✦</em></span>
</div></div>

<main class="wrap">
<!-- 壹 · 新品上市 -->
<section class="blk" id="new">
<div class="chap rv">
<div class="l"><span class="no">壹</span><h2>新品上市</h2></div>
<a class="more" href="shop.html">查看全部 36 款 →</a>
<p>每一件都以节气与草木命名,面料均可溯源。</p>
</div>
<div class="pgrid">

<article class="pcard rv">
<div class="stage" style="--gc:#E3D2B4"><span class="tag">新品</span>
<svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><path fill="#C9A87C" d="M42 26 L54 17 Q60 14 66 17 L78 26 L89 48 L80 55 L77 99 Q60 106 43 99 L40 55 L31 48 Z"/><path d="M54 19 L60 34 L66 19" fill="none" stroke="rgba(40,25,8,.35)" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M60 34 V99" stroke="rgba(40,25,8,.18)" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="44" y="60" width="32" height="5" fill="rgba(40,25,8,.28)"/></svg></div>
